category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libcurl-devel libxml2-devel
sdesc: "MPEG-DASH Access Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libdash is the official reference software of the ISO/IEC MPEG-DASH standard
and is an open-source library that provides an object orient (OO) interface to
the MPEG-DASH standard, developed by bitmovin."
